# Overlay series fragment build: applied after atlas/patches/series and the fragments before it
# (file-name order). Owner: ATLAS-ANCHOR (the anchor patch). One entry per line, a path under atlas/patches.
# atlas-series refuses a patch listed twice and a patch number used twice, and warns when a number
# is outside this range:
# range: 0010-0010
build/0010-atlas-anchors.patch
